sequenceDiagram
  actor Person
  participant UI
  participant Controller
  participant Safety
  participant LLM
  participant Evidence
  participant Device
  Person->>UI: Describe concern
  UI->>Controller: Persist answers
  Controller->>Safety: Check urgent signals
  alt Urgent signal
    Safety-->>UI: Fixed local response
  else No identified urgent signal
    Controller->>LLM: Scoped state and allowed tools
    LLM->>Evidence: Request approved passages
    Evidence-->>LLM: Passages or no support
    LLM-->>Controller: Propose useful measurement
    Controller-->>UI: Feasible request with reason
    Person->>UI: Accept or decline
    UI->>Controller: Actual choice
    Controller->>Device: Acquire if accepted and available
    Device-->>Controller: Result or failure
    Controller->>LLM: Persisted outcome
    LLM-->>Controller: Assessment and gaps
    Controller-->>UI: Validated explanation
  end
